sequenceDiagram
  participant OS
  participant Shell
  participant Worker
  participant Renderer

  OS->>Shell: launch
  Shell->>Shell: acquire single-instance lock
  Shell->>Shell: open splash + mint bearer token
  Shell->>Shell: run SQLite migrations
  Shell->>Worker: spawn (env: PORT=0, TOKEN, DATA_DIR)
  Worker->>Worker: bind 127.0.0.1:random
  Worker-->>Shell: stdout "READY {port}"
  loop until 200 or 30s
    Shell->>Worker: GET /healthz
  end
  Worker-->>Shell: 200 ready
  Shell-->>Shell: emit I_SHELL_READY
  Shell->>Renderer: create WebView, inject {port, token, version}
  Renderer->>Shell: load app://index.html
  Shell->>Shell: close splash
